OL,3,GNEWSAArran ferry evacuated over 'bomb
OL,4,Athreat' as passenger rescued from sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ferry operator said emergency
OL,7,Fprotocols were put in place. The vessel
OL,8,Fwas searched and 329 people were
OL,9,Fremoved on foot when it berthed at
OL,10,FArdrossan.
